<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-row">
      <view class="hero-mark">
        <ui-icon name="route" size="40" color="#5C7A5A"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="eyebrow">PROGRESS</text>
        <text class="hero-title">学习进度</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-sub">在课程目录点课即进入智学。未选课时智学先给引导语；已选课则按智能体内置问答推进，不另编环节。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card topic-box">
    <view class="title">按引导输入课题</view>
    <view class="muted">智学引导语问课题名称时，把知识库中的原题贴在这里开始。</view>
    <input
      class="field"
      placeholder="输入智学知识库中的课题名称"
      value="{{topicDraft}}"
      bindinput="onTopicDraft"
      confirm-type="done"
      bindconfirm="onStartTopic"
    />
    <button class="btn" bindtap="onStartTopic">开始智学</button>
  </view>

  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="route" size="48" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    正在读取学习记录…
  </view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !sections.length}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="book-open" size="48" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    还没有学习记录。去课程目录点一门课，或按智学引导输入课题原题。
    <button class="btn" bindtap="onBrowse">去选课</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="section">
    <view class="section-head">
      <ui-icon name="folder" size="32" color="#5C7A5A"></ui-icon>
      <text class="name">{{section.name}}</text>
      <text class="count">{{section.courses.length}} 门</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card row course-card" wx:for="{{section.courses}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="id">
      <image class="cover" src="{{item.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" wx:if="{{item.coverUrl}}"></image>
      <view class="cover cover-fallback" wx:else>
        <ui-icon name="book" size="48" color="#7A9A74"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="title">{{item.displayTitle}}</view>
        <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.stepCount}}">第 {{item.currentIndex + 1}} / {{item.stepCount}} 环节 · {{item.stepTitle}}</view>
        <view class="muted" wx:else>{{item.stepTitle || '按智学问答继续'}}</view>
        <view class="progress-line">
          <view class="fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%;"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">已完成 {{item.completedCount || 0}} 环节</view>
        <view class="row">
          <button
            class="btn mini"
            size="mini"
            data-id="{{item.course.id}}"
            data-matched="{{item.matchedFlag}}"
            data-title="{{item.displayTitle}}"
            bindtap="onOpen"
          >继续智学</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
